sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as WalletController
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant Coin as CoinsService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext
    participant Email as IEmailSender

    C->>API: POST /api/wallet/sell {coinId, quantity}
    Note over API: [Authorize] validates JWT before controller
    API->>API: Extract userId from claims (NameIdentifier or sub)
    alt missing/invalid userId
        API-->>C: 401 Unauthorized {message}
    else userId ok
        API->>WS: SellAsync(userId, dto)
        WS->>DB: Load wallet (+holdings) by userId
        WS->>WS: Find holding by coinId
        alt holding missing or quantity too low
            WS-->>API: throw Exception("Not enough coins to sell")
            API-->>C: 500 (unhandled exception by default)
        else can sell
            WS->>Coin: GetCurrentPriceAsync(coinId)
            Coin->>DB: Read coin current price (CoinsMarket)
            DB-->>Coin: price
            Coin-->>WS: price
            WS->>DB: Reduce/remove holding
            WS->>DB: Update wallet balance
            WS->>DB: Add Transaction (Sell)
            WS->>DB: SaveChanges
            WS->>Email: Send wallet email (best-effort)
            WS->>DB: Check low-balance alerts + write notifications (best-effort)
            WS-->>API: BuySellResponseDto {type,price,quantity,newBalance}
            API-->>C: 200 OK (BuySellResponseDto)
        end
    end
